{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/47e1dff306ce4122811018da01cda4ce.poster.avif?t=1761901541\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/47e1dff306ce4122811018da01cda4ce.webm?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/47e1dff306ce4122811018da01cda4ce.mp4?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 ship variations based on 8 historical models. Command your vessel in real-time sea battles, choose your tactics, and form your own fleet as you explore the Caribbean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/fd86643324e00159628b455b0575f07e.poster.avif?t=1761901541\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/fd86643324e00159628b455b0575f07e.webm?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/fd86643324e00159628b455b0575f07e.mp4?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After cannon fire comes close combat. Board enemy ships and fight on deck, in the hold, and in the captain\u2019s cabin, while your officers and crew battle at your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/7cb417a4a5c2acd5f3192047afb6f4aa.poster.avif?t=1761901541\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/7cb417a4a5c2acd5f3192047afb6f4aa.webm?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/7cb417a4a5c2acd5f3192047afb6f4aa.mp4?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail freely across ports, hidden coves, trade routes and dangerous patrol zones. Take contracts, hunt treasures, smuggle goods, or simply chart your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/940e101cb15c0702567d08a2883b1d9c.poster.avif?t=1761901541\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/940e101cb15c0702567d08a2883b1d9c.webm?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/940e101cb15c0702567d08a2883b1d9c.mp4?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rufus Monroe, a smuggler whose routine mission near Trinidad and Tobago goes wrong and triggers a struggle with empires, pirates, and shifting loyalties. Your choices shape your crew, your reputation, and your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get ready to set sail on the adventure in Corsairs Legacy! Can you survive the dangers of the Caribbean and become a legendary captain, or will you fall at the hands of your enemies? The choice is yours in this game. Corsairs Legacy awaits!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Drop the anchor! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/42478ccc243e0f279336e61b81074ca18317f74d.jpg"},{"name":"Raise the Jolly Roger!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/885d8419cf11ac4340a80dddc00ae1bc3ad7c130.jpg"},{"name":"Straight to the bottom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/11f164adbbb841cdaa47223ab7b2816d2669006b.jpg"},{"name":"Let's give them a taste of gunpowder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/e75e87f467d3514860fcac4f40be0e2a96fa685f.jpg"},{"name":"Grappling hooks to the board!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/859be9f3baa1399e2a6d1e4b3a7ee4c3ce9ebf48.jpg"},{"name":"Prepare a boarding party!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/015c695047748240d9e2296bec46ed515014d0fb.jpg"},{"name":"Covered in Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/1fb721c3ac0f343d1bd6dbb262a96b4e1ceb2f66.jpg"},{"name":"The Butcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/85f66c9fc79925f9163b06f3e265280b2190e531.jpg"},{"name":"Bull\u2019s Eye!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/6a986bc2b03ff57692a017465b1ef39ae6c9695d.jpg"},{"name":"The Gunslinger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594880/004ee7e3f1ea5db6d311738c2e710aa268ce0b4c.jpg"}],"total":68},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1594880?t=1761901541","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761901541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/4de27795a0ed566842925fc7140255815c7bb76c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761901541","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/4de27795a0ed566842925fc7140255815c7bb76c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761901541","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2289330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/47e1dff306ce4122811018da01cda4ce.poster.avif?t=1761901541\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/47e1dff306ce4122811018da01cda4ce.webm?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/47e1dff306ce4122811018da01cda4ce.mp4?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 ship variations based on 8 historical models. Command your vessel in real-time sea battles, choose your tactics, and form your own fleet as you explore the Caribbean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/fd86643324e00159628b455b0575f07e.poster.avif?t=1761901541\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/fd86643324e00159628b455b0575f07e.webm?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/fd86643324e00159628b455b0575f07e.mp4?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After cannon fire comes close combat. Board enemy ships and fight on deck, in the hold, and in the captain\u2019s cabin, while your officers and crew battle at your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/7cb417a4a5c2acd5f3192047afb6f4aa.poster.avif?t=1761901541\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/7cb417a4a5c2acd5f3192047afb6f4aa.webm?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/7cb417a4a5c2acd5f3192047afb6f4aa.mp4?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail freely across ports, hidden coves, trade routes and dangerous patrol zones. Take contracts, hunt treasures, smuggle goods, or simply chart your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/940e101cb15c0702567d08a2883b1d9c.poster.avif?t=1761901541\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/940e101cb15c0702567d08a2883b1d9c.webm?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/extras/940e101cb15c0702567d08a2883b1d9c.mp4?t=1761901541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rufus Monroe, a smuggler whose routine mission near Trinidad and Tobago goes wrong and triggers a struggle with empires, pirates, and shifting loyalties. Your choices shape your crew, your reputation, and your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get ready to set sail on the adventure in Corsairs Legacy! Can you survive the dangers of the Caribbean and become a legendary captain, or will you fall at the hands of your enemies? The choice is yours in this game. Corsairs Legacy awaits!</p>","developers":["Mauris"],"dlc":[2461620],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594880/388686ea9d92f7ac3ea4fca8638cbb4597de7075/header.jpg?t=1761901541","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1594880/1576214628/fd7374d54b7140e4e0f946c28f435630100d38b2/1761506699/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761557156","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1594880/1576214628/fd7374d54b7140e4e0f946c28f435630100d38b2/1761506699/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761557156","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1594880/1576214628/fd7374d54b7140e4e0f946c28f435630100d38b2/1761506699/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761557156","id":257222773,"name":"Release Trailer EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257222773/a2a4cfe479279c0479cc7da8fd38d376249dda40/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761557156"}],"name":"Corsairs Legacy - Pirate Action RPG & Sea Battles","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Corsai